"type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I think to get good use out of CodeEdit, you would need to have a script to configure it anyway, so it's fine to hide these.\r\nFor example, `code_completion_prefixes` just emits a signal that you need to connect to. \r\nThe delimiters affect various parts of the logic, it needs to be better explained in the documentation, but it doesn't do much on its own, it mostly just handles edge cases for other features. So while it would be nice to have in the inspector, I don't think it is important enough to need to be there.\r\n\r\nPressing backspace after adding an entry makes it empty, so you do allow empty values.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107529#pullrequestreview-2958403066","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107529","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107529#pullrequestreview-2958403066"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107529"}},"submitted_at":"2025-06-25T15:02:44Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2959650944,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6waLCA","user":{"login":"nico-tome","id":85362665,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1MzYyNjY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85362665?u=75a6a4b035cca11d3fc957f7bb2e21267978f166&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nico-tome","html_url":"https://github.com/nico-tome","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nico-tome/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nico-tome/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nico-tome/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nico-tome/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nico-tome/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nico-tome/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nico-tome/repos","